---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Band from '../components/Band.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Why Amadunia exists, what it takes from other languages, and how it is being built."
>
  <Band name="About">
    <h1 class="h-section">A language you can finish learning.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Amadunia is a world auxiliary language assembled from the parts of other languages that
      people learn fastest, and stripped of the parts they never stop tripping over.
    </p>
    <p style="margin-top:1.5rem">
      Placeholder. Say who the language is for, what problem it answers, and what it deliberately
      refuses to do.
    </p>
    <p>
      Placeholder. Name the languages the vocabulary and sound system draw on, and the principle
      used to choose between them.
    </p>
  </Band>

  <Band name="Design rules" count="3">
    <h2 class="h-section">What the project holds itself to.</h2>
    <ol class="rules" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
      <li>
        <div>
          <h3 class="rule__claim">No exceptions</h3>
          <p class="rule__body">
            A rule with an exception is two rules. Anything that needs one is left out of the
            language instead.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <div>
          <h3 class="rule__claim">Easy for the most people, not for the fewest</h3>
          <p class="rule__body">
            Sounds and structures are chosen by how widely they are already shared, not by how
            elegant they look on paper.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <div>
          <h3 class="rule__claim">Small enough to hold in your head</h3>
          <p class="rule__body">
            If the grammar stops fitting on one page, something has gone wrong and gets removed.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </Band>

  <Band name="The project">
    <h2 class="h-section">How it is being built.</h2>
    <div class="panel">
      <p>
        Amadunia is developed in the open under the MIT licence. Proposals, objections, and word
        submissions go through
        <a href="https://github.com/recepcinet/amadunia.com">the repository</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Band>
</Base>
